   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Dos Banjos (3)** (1 other source): Played as Dos Billys: Billy Strings on clawhammer banjo, joined by Billy Failing on banjo [1]\n- **Stratosphere Blues / I Believe In You (4)** (1 other source): Billy Strings plays a Martin Grand J-28E, with Royal Masat on Nord Stage 3 keyboard and Billy Failing on baritone banjo [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Sugar Hill Ramble**: rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n- **Pyramid Country &gt**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Country Blues (2)**: rare: 10 archived performances [4]\n- **She Left Me Standing on the Mountain**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Wait A Minute**: rare: 5 archived performances [4]\n- **End Of The Rainbow &gt**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Dawg’s Rag**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 5 archived performances [4]\n- **Don’t Think Twice, It’s Alright**: back after 144 archived shows (1013 days); rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2025-12-10.umamibeat** (recommended): source not stated; 27 songs; 147 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **billystrings2025-12-10**: source not stated; 28 songs; 142 min [2]. Said about its sound: Light processing only: high-pass filter at 65 Hz, gentle EQ, light compression and a limiter. Dynamics are preserved, with no aggressive normalization; The recording has a cut, with audible interference around it, which the taper chooses not to explain [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2025-12-10.umamibeat**: taped by Jimmy Lu (umamibeat); transferred by Jimmy Lu (umamibeat); source: DPA 2012 > Zoom F3; DPA 2012 [1]\n- **billystrings2025-12-10**: taped by Neil Frost; transferred by Frostbyte; source: Shure MV88 ➔ iPhone [2]. Also: Recorded from Row J, seat 5 with a Shure MV88 into an iPhone voice app, then Audacity and FLAC [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Blaxteeco: [Billy Strings Tulsa Oklahoma 2025 Event Poster At Bok Center On December 10 2025 The Flying Bison Art Home Decor Poster ](https://blaxteeco.com/product/billy-strings-tulsa-oklahoma-2025-event-poster-at-bok-center-on-december-10-2025-the-flying-bison-art-home-decor-poster-canvas/) [5]\n- Poster by Teesprime: [Original Billy Strings Tulsa Oklahoma 2025 Event Poster At Bok Center On December 10 2025 The Flying Bison Art shirt, ho](https://teesprime.com/product/original-billy-strings-tulsa-oklahoma-2025-event-poster-at-bok-center-on-december-10-2025-the-flying-bison-art-shirt/) [6]\n- Poster by Teeextra: [Official Billy Strings Tulsa Oklahoma 2025 At Bok Center On December 10 2025 The Flying Bison Shirt, hoodie, sweater, lo](https://teeextra.com/product/official-billy-strings-tulsa-oklahoma-2025-at-bok-center-on-december-10-2025-the-flying-bison-shirt/) [7]\n- Poster by Blaxteeco: [Billy Strings Tulsa Oklahoma 2025 Event Poster At Bok Center On December 10 2025 The Flying Bison Art All Over Print Shi](https://blaxteeco.com/product/billy-strings-tulsa-oklahoma-2025-event-poster-at-bok-center-on-december-10-2025-the-flying-bison-art-all-over-print-shirt/) [8]\n- Poster by Teesprime: [Original Billy Strings Tulsa Oklahoma 2025 Event Poster At Bok Center On December 10 2025 The Flying Bison Art shirt, ho](https://teesprime.com/product/original-billy-strings-tulsa-oklahoma-2025-event-poster-at-bok-center-on-december-10-2025-the-flying-bison-art-shirt/) [9]",
